Fix numeric timezone saves and distinguish external from embedded tzdata.

Backport the source change from GCC commit 864f26bd7548d1a290b334b8f5375199449fcff5
for PR libstdc++/124851.  Also track the active tzdata_stream union member
explicitly.  Comparing the addresses of the overlapping filebuf and spanbuf
members incorrectly identifies external tzdata as embedded data, allowing a
missing or invalid external leapseconds file to pass silently.

IERS Bulletin C 72 confirms that no leap second will be introduced at the end
of December 2026, so extend the hardcoded leap table's validity through the
next possible leap-second boundary.

